{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d419df52a8c63377cfc44277188b225a39e0abddddbe1dfba6677eb476c6f13", "ja": "（次の定期公演でお披露目する予定の、新曲が届いた。\n歌詞は仮歌だけど……亜利沙はもう、来ているかな）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演预定要首次演出的新歌送来了。歌词还是临时版，不过……亚利沙已经来了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c678d081cdd87d3696794a461e9fc266cb6fb8fdbaa50ef531fbc39f0131474f", "ja": "ムフ……ムフフ♪\nアイドルちゃんのお宝が……たくさん……ムフフ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……嘿嘿嘿♪  \n偶像们的宝物……好多……嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0920a949777be966427af87e1998ca0a0ae13fc3938d1982d98bfb188ffde72a", "ja": "亜利沙、お待たせ……って、どうかしたのか？\nなんだか、上の空みたいだけど……。", "zh": "亜利沙，让你久等了……咦，你这是怎么了？\n感觉你有点心不在焉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "d512020f9e8a658ccc2504a4667fb87f6c4041585440fd4e08772f0dc00ea31c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです！　それが……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了！其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "751ad9247c6983a391f889fb8cd6700c10225a8a48f54590f6d97b6d36c9f874", "ja": "それが、グッズにサインをしてあげたら、\nなんだか興奮しちゃったみたいで……。", "zh": "是这样的，我给周边签了名之后，她好像有点兴奋过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "140dd2290722c2dd3237f95acb2bdabae49296035fa066b954fb5092d51d4e52", "ja": "ほらほら、亜利沙ちゃん！\n{$P$}さんが来たよ？", "zh": "看呀看呀，亚利沙！\n{$P$}先生来了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "c9b1a277ab61eaf54bfc8e506f9374957aa41bcb5e40b257c84a41cb30e1a5af", "ja": "はっ！　お、お疲れ様です、\n{$P$}さんっ！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "啊！您、您辛苦了，{$P$}先生！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fa4eb2ac6ba242529564305a4a536f465d6bc537c8c793456df95c40abe49723", "ja": "お疲れさま。まだちょっと、\n心ここにあらずって感じだな……。", "zh": "辛苦了。看起来还是有点心不在焉啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "38c839501874baaade0d7a566aacf82e8cc08222952bc9ae73f094dc52e85cd7", "ja": "一度こうなると、亜利沙はなかなか\n戻ってこられへんからな～。", "zh": "一旦变成这样，亚利沙就很难回过神来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1010_p", "source_sha256": "311a5d2f9b12f9a3a26083651d83c0a7894cb1b0cbf874c075f68a6debb97a7c", "ja": "大丈夫だ。そんな亜利沙の目も覚ますような、\nとっておきのビッグニュースを持ってきたからな！", "zh": "没问题。我带来了一个能让这样的亚利沙\n也彻底清醒过来的珍藏大新闻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "aba9097c6945bedec810b4a45c6d3e2a5eab8727c88a757934062a3c7300b238", "ja": "ビッグニュース？", "zh": "大新闻？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "aba9097c6945bedec810b4a45c6d3e2a5eab8727c88a757934062a3c7300b238", "ja": "ビッグニュース？", "zh": "大新闻？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1013_p", "source_sha256": "801bf82cf8c48a1633dc8aecd35ffc4a13d10c6a379f8547bfa93eb45649577c", "ja": "ああ。次の公演で披露する、新曲ができたんだ。\n歌うのは亜利沙だ。よろしくな！", "zh": "啊。下一场公演要演出的新歌已经写好了。\n由亜利沙来唱。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "80f462b3b9c5c279f355f727917369ea74ab0db253b5c5ed14881e8b67720221", "ja": "新曲ですか！　それは是非とも参加を……って、\nえええええっ！？　し、新曲担当！？　ありさが！？", "zh": "是新歌吗！那我一定要参加……呃，\n诶诶诶诶诶！？新、新歌的演唱者！？是亚利沙！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "2730e6ce46fb7af87ee2fca54e685ca1687ad036c0e7c639c12f87c8d7aa5f70", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ライブ初披露の新曲って\n目玉ですよ！？　それを、ありさが歌うんですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，在演唱会上首次公开的新曲\n可是重头戏啊！？而那首歌，要由亚利沙来唱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1016_p", "source_sha256": "85abdb0b4b1ec7203a05d3036c6d29c8f76676c6339dc5c2486677cad129a195", "ja": "だからそう言ってるじゃないか。美奈子と奈緒も、\n今回の公演のメンバーだ。よろしくな！", "zh": "所以我不是这么说的吗。美奈子和奈绪也是这次公演的成员。好好加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "6b720248790cf7732a70563f88f13ca65cf06cb7f97b1874d53011331025355f", "ja": "はいっ、了解です！　新曲かぁ～、いいな～♪\nおめでとう、亜利沙ちゃん！", "zh": "好的，明白了！新歌啊～真不错～♪\n恭喜你，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "b02620a85338a146944371d9ce835bd2c6ea2910a745d6a38f684c5f3fe0fbfe", "ja": "良かったな、亜利沙！\nこれは私らで、めっちゃ盛り上げなあかんな～。", "zh": "太好了，亚利纱！\n这下得由咱们把气氛炒得热热闹闹才行啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "dcd9750acf0fc036b6429d5786000dc125b4d0d0ec27d10b9cc3a787e5fab7e4", "ja": "美奈子ちゃん、奈緒ちゃん……\nあ、ありがとうございます……うぅ……。", "zh": "美奈子、奈绪……\n谢、谢谢你们……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cb391b85b7060f08cb312e8b6934b64928268a7abfb81cb7daecb9cb6727e389", "ja": "亜利沙、どうしたんだ？\n嬉しくないのか？", "zh": "亚利沙，怎么了？\n不开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "5987bf15eb2101a42374af9a41c80ac9e3b6aa13bd516f101721c3a9c3d6149e", "ja": "い、いえっ！　新しいありさの曲、\nとってもうれしいです！　で、デモ……！", "zh": "不、不是！能有属于亚利沙的新歌，我真的特别开心！只、只是试听曲……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b6572ec804927cda7dda349625eb087dbc96d9f77016ceb973e7728491fa509", "ja": "美奈子ちゃんや奈緒ちゃんより早く、2曲目なんて！\nあ、ありさには、分不相応なのでは……！", "zh": "竟然比美奈子和奈绪更早拿到第2首歌！\n这、这对亚利沙来说，实在是受之有愧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "8ea79f39a4c54c95b97500cd8255ffb4f40fcc5937aa72caeeb65e56439233e9", "ja": "なに言うてんねん。今回先なだけで、私らだって曲は\nもらえるんですよね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "你在说什么呢。这次只是我先拿到而已，我们也会有歌曲的，对吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a4ac9207aabbe606da855b60adeb2a665cc777005c1d6c584d3b77f96a30783c", "ja": "もちろん。ふたりの曲も準備しているところだから、\n楽しみにしていてほしい。", "zh": "当然了。两人的曲子也在准备当中，\n敬请期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "17ec2491628a9fd07745378e2587ba60596756393445817df0375611d6614cf4", "ja": "な？　せやから亜利沙はそんなこと気にせんと\n自分の曲がんばればええやん！", "zh": "对吧？所以亜利沙你就别在意那些了，好好努力准备自己的歌不就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "e7e80dc51f4648e19c6029e13b9595fd417fcaf62a459b1f941deffee1267ce1", "ja": "そうそう！　私たちも、一緒に公演に出るんだし。\n亜利沙ちゃんのサポート、させてほしいな♪", "zh": "对呀！我们也要一起参加公演嘛。也请让我们来支持亚利沙吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "b04b6a713388a0e4f92f96df201bd8b833d167c91e5fa905efe9e784482514b6", "ja": "サポート……ううっ。わ、わかりました……。\nおふたりにそこまで言われたら、ありさは……。", "zh": "支援……呜呜。好、好的……。\n既然两位都说到这个份上了，亚利沙也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "1bfa03ad83519bf2260785e1435b0cbd6ca9a43e4cc5d5615987b0308bf784b4", "ja": "ありさは、逃げるワケには行きませんっ！\nテンションMAXで、がんばりますよぉ～！", "zh": "亚利沙绝对不能临阵脱逃！\n我会把干劲拉到最高，全力以赴的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "f1e0d69e7789c1c4cdfca9c462f74a74e8da61649280b83a76e1de01d773cc28", "ja": "その意気やで、亜利沙！\nみんなで、最高の公演目指そな♪", "zh": "就是要有这股干劲，亚利沙！\n我们一起朝着最棒的公演努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1032_p", "source_sha256": "58cd2785e964b5c90d311024c0f9619bed231ada2a938cd7767cf6fb27d6574c", "ja": "（奈緒と美奈子に励まされて、亜利沙の\nモチベーションも、どうにか持ち直したみたいだな）", "zh": "（在奈绪和美奈子的鼓励下，亚利沙的干劲似乎总算恢复过来了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_052_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4d9cd4a3c45374ea798fb5240a1eb14164beada5f1ae308c47403738dce7438b", "ja": "（ちょっとヤケクソ気味なのが気になるけど……\nまずは、新曲をどう仕上げていくか考えないとな）", "zh": "（虽然感觉有点自暴自弃……但首先还是得考虑一下该如何完成新曲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
